# The bundled pdfjs library and its worker are third-party build output, not
# source. Git's line-ending conversion would rewrite them on checkout — 1.7MB
# of minified JavaScript, altered on a fresh clone for no reason, in files the
# WebView bridge reads verbatim and inlines into a page.
#
# `-text` turns that off entirely: what was committed is what lands on disk.
assets/pdfjs/*.pdfjs -text
public/pdf.worker.min.mjs -text
